{"id":"n14003-2-7","stage":0,"title":"답 · 应答","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14003-2-7-1","ko":"삼 번 문제 답이 뭔지 알아?","zh":"你知道第三题的答案是什么吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼","meaning":"第三","explanation":"삼：第三。","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61980","senseId":"2","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}},{"text":"번","meaning":"号（题号）","explanation":"번：表示编号或顺序；삼 번 문제 合起来指“第三题”。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"1","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}},{"text":"문제","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}},{"text":"답이","meaning":"答案","explanation":"답：问题的答案；-이 标记主语，这里是“第三题的答案”。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답이","audio":"/audio/d09f8b157c83a3fab723.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔지","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔지","audio":"/audio/f1fa2ef3977aec58566d.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL K